# What a CLI deploy must not upload.
#
# Git-integration deploys only ever see committed files, so this matters for
# `vercel deploy` from a working tree — which is how the export-market demos
# are put up before their branch is merged.

# Reference material: the original bakery's own photographs and a copyrighted
# paper. Kept local rather than redistributed, same reason as in .gitignore.
/idea/

# Secrets and local state. Vercel supplies the environment itself.
.env*
/.vercel/

# Build output and dependencies. Vercel installs and builds its own.
/node_modules/
/.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
